# Weekly journal scan: raw Crossref dumps are regenerable, so they stay out of git.
# The scanner, the seen-DOI ledger, and the reviewed digests are tracked â€” the
# ledger in particular must persist, or every week re-surfaces the same papers.
.editorial/weekly/candidates-*.tsv
